WEBVTT

00:00:28.544 --> 00:00:31.354
Odrastao sam zadivljen.

00:00:31.354 --> 00:00:35.469
Odrastao sam među ovim životinjama.

00:00:35.469 --> 00:00:39.860
Odrastao sam u divljem
istočnom dijelu Južne Afrike

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.758
u Rezervatu za divlje životinje Londolozi.

00:00:42.758 --> 00:00:45.530
Ondje moja obitelj

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:49.725
već četiri generacije organizira safarije.

00:00:49.725 --> 00:00:51.962
Otkad znam za sebe

00:00:51.962 --> 00:00:56.699
posao mi je da ljude vodim u prirodu

00:00:56.699 --> 00:00:59.610
i mislim da sam divnim spletom okolnosti

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:01.430
dobio priliku